The Go rendering: an application whose iota groups are only compared and
copied: two results spread into two parameters, a pointer, assignments, String
methods the program calls directly and through a method value, a struct that
embeds the type compared by value, a channel the program makes, and an exported
field of an exported type of an application. One group is named only from a
function nothing calls.

